{
  "groups": [
    {
      "groupIndex": 1,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-0959eef2-3c7d-5b33-a109-ddf332a5dbd9-required-by-4d9defde-d3bc-5c43-83ff-9cf6f2930643",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "0959eef2-3c7d-5b33-a109-ddf332a5dbd9",
      "directDependentGoalId": "4d9defde-d3bc-5c43-83ff-9cf6f2930643",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "Both biodiesel cases require triglyceride structure and mixture identity, separation of direct oil use from methyl esters, motor suitability and origin-dependent environmental limits. Those are the oil competence itself; transesterification is the added dependent operation."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Der Biodieselauftrag verlangt selbst Triglyceridbau und Gemischcharakter, Abgrenzung direkter Ölnutzung, Motoreignung und Herkunfts-/Flächenfolgen. Diese Struktur-, Einsatz- und Herkunftsunterscheidungen bilden genau die Pflanzenölkompetenz; ohne sie wäre die Umesterungs- und Rohstoffbewertung fachlich unvollständig."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 2,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-0e3f849b-133d-57da-882c-0d67c3eb05b8-required-by-b8c8f70f-64cb-50b1-970c-e0c4295da3fb",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "0e3f849b-133d-57da-882c-0d67c3eb05b8",
      "directDependentGoalId": "b8c8f70f-64cb-50b1-970c-e0c4295da3fb",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "The quantitative profile explicitly requires proportional charge-to-amount reasoning, different electron numbers, separation of amount and mass, and current-efficiency boundaries, including a separate qualitative case. These are exactly the two qualitative Faraday relationships, not merely a convenient calculation route."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Die quantitative Faraday-Leistung verlangt Q→Elektronen→Produkt, Erklärung von z, getrennte Stoffmengen-/Massenvergleiche und Stromausbeute. Damit sind gerade die proportionalen und stoffabhängigen qualitativen Beziehungen zu begründen; bloße Formelsubstitution erfüllt das aktuelle abhängige Profil nicht."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 7,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-13d4f336-ab16-54a7-9479-c920b458f385-required-by-02634fdd-c8ba-591a-b240-77129b1bebb8",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "13d4f336-ab16-54a7-9479-c920b458f385",
      "directDependentGoalId": "02634fdd-c8ba-591a-b240-77129b1bebb8",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "The dependent requires actual supervised titration with handling, addition and documentation. Correct eye protection, clear labelled workspace and stopping for an unclear vessel or splash are necessary parts of that safe practical performance; paper calculation alone cannot stand for the dependent's whole performance."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Titration schließt tatsächliches beaufsichtigtes Arbeiten mit Säure/Base, Gefäßzuordnung und kontrollierter Zugabe ein. Sichere Vorbereitung und angemessene Sofortreaktion auf Spritzer/unklare Beschriftung sind dafür notwendige Sicherheitskompetenz; Papierauswertung ersetzt sie nicht."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 11,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-1dc15fa2-fca4-56b0-b5c1-4d215613dde0-required-by-02634fdd-c8ba-591a-b240-77129b1bebb8",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "1dc15fa2-fca4-56b0-b5c1-4d215613dde0",
      "directDependentGoalId": "02634fdd-c8ba-591a-b240-77129b1bebb8",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "The titration profile requires independently developing analytical amount/volume references, distinguishing aliquot amounts from concentration, and deriving 1:1 versus 1:2 stoichiometry. Meaningful use of mol for named entities and constituent ratios is necessary to do this rather than only substitute numbers."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Das Titrationsprofil verlangt die eigenständige Entwicklung von n=cV, analytischer Stoffmenge, Reaktionsfaktor und proportionalem Aliquot. Das setzt mol als eindeutig auf benannte Teilchen bezogene Zählgröße voraus; Verwechslung von Molekül-/Ionen-/Formeleinheiten würde die Stoffmengenbilanz ungültig machen."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 12,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-1e5a4b89-69f1-5379-811e-c8ec76faad2a-required-by-2924f784-5261-54e8-93ee-49ac3b3cd300",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "1e5a4b89-69f1-5379-811e-c8ec76faad2a",
      "directDependentGoalId": "2924f784-5261-54e8-93ee-49ac3b3cd300",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "The dependent interprets a condition-specific molar gas volume and compares different ideal gases and changed pressure. The Avogadro relation between equal V at equal T,p and equal particle amount is necessary to justify that common molar-volume model and its limits."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Der molare-Volumenauftrag gilt für unterschiedliche ideale Gase und verlangt passenden T/p-Bezug und erhaltene Stoffmenge. Die gemeinsame Volumen-pro-mol-Beziehung bei gleichem T/p setzt genau Avogadros Teilchenzahlvergleich voraus; ohne diese Bedingung wäre die Übertragung des Vm unbegründet."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 17,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-36666b4a-97af-51fc-9983-56cdcc7a8229-required-by-3c9bfa10-9a13-50cc-96c8-6213e28d6c54",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "36666b4a-97af-51fc-9983-56cdcc7a8229",
      "directDependentGoalId": "3c9bfa10-9a13-50cc-96c8-6213e28d6c54",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "The CFC and HFC tasks require checking author, date, purpose, advertising claim, competing evidence and claim-specific limits. Comparing relevance, trustworthiness and validity of sources is necessary to the dependent's explicitly source-critical judgment."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Die Halogenkohlenwasserstofffälle verlangen ein Quellenurteil gegen einseitige Werbung und begrenzte Wirkungsaussagen. Relevanz, Urheber, Intention und tatsächliche Belege müssen gerade für die konkrete chemische Frage verglichen werden; ohne diese Quellenkritik ist die verlangte Bewertung nicht erbracht."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 22,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-431a0f03-f28a-5e56-a61f-000336d0b410-required-by-1df17884-96ae-57d7-9da9-dbebd082596f",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "431a0f03-f28a-5e56-a61f-000336d0b410",
      "directDependentGoalId": "1df17884-96ae-57d7-9da9-dbebd082596f",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "The dependent must derive criteria, produce evidence-grounded chances/risks for options, weigh them with an explicit strategy and revise the decision under changed conditions. Finding and weighting one's own pro/con arguments against a supplied claim is necessary to those whole decision tasks."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Die Handlungsentscheidung muss eigene Kriterien und belegte Chancen/Risiken entwickeln, vorgegebene Pauschalargumente prüfen und unter geänderten Bedingungen neu gewichten. Diese tatsächliche Pro-/Kontra-Abwägung ist der fachliche Entscheidungskern des abhängigen Profils."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 23,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-431a0f03-f28a-5e56-a61f-000336d0b410-required-by-64a5bb87-358d-5a22-958a-f66ba5521cd5",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "431a0f03-f28a-5e56-a61f-000336d0b410",
      "directDependentGoalId": "64a5bb87-358d-5a22-958a-f66ba5521cd5",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "Protein-product tasks require own sourced ecological, economic and ethical arguments, equivalent protein/function bases, a counter-source and explicit weighting. The prerequisite's independently generated and weighed pro/con arguments are the necessary reasoning operation, rather than optional background."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Der Proteinvergleich fordert selbst recherchierte ökologische, ökonomische und ethische Argumente, Gegenquelle und ausdrücklich begründete Gewichtung. Ein fertiger Quellenstapel oder Produktetiketten genügen nicht; die eigene kriteriengeleitete Pro-/Kontra-Abwägung wird dabei notwendig vollzogen."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 26,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-4aa3a130-b517-5ac5-87b2-147fe432cadd-required-by-ba621c67-b750-5e45-ab37-a51ea45e3ccf",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "4aa3a130-b517-5ac5-87b2-147fe432cadd",
      "directDependentGoalId": "ba621c67-b750-5e45-ab37-a51ea45e3ccf",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "Photometry requires judging blank, calibration range, nonlinearity, reference-control bias and the distinction between repeatability and accuracy. Claim-specific adequacy, confounds and bounded data conclusions are necessary to deciding whether a computed concentration may be released."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Fotometrie verlangt gültigen Kalibrierbereich, Blank/Referenz, Fehlergrenzen und das Zurückhalten eines bei fehlgeschlagener Kontrolle vorläufigen Gehalts. Genau diese Prüfung von Angemessenheit, Gültigkeit und Tragweite chemischer Daten ist unverzichtbar."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 27,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-4aa3a130-b517-5ac5-87b2-147fe432cadd-required-by-e313c1ee-a617-54ed-adea-c183da1e03d8",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "4aa3a130-b517-5ac5-87b2-147fe432cadd",
      "directDependentGoalId": "e313c1ee-a617-54ed-adea-c183da1e03d8",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "Both purity-content cases require selecting a selective method, assessing blanks/repeats/drying, and rejecting nonselective mass loss or an interfering soluble component. Assessing adequacy, possible procedural errors and the limits of chemical data is directly necessary to the dependent's reliability judgment."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Eine Gehaltsbestimmung verlangt Selektivität, richtigen Nenner und Bewertung von Nachwaschen, Trocknung, Streuung und störenden flüchtigen Stoffen. Ohne die Aussagekraft-/Fehlerprüfung wäre eine Masse fälschlich ein eindeutiger Reinstoffnachweis."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 28,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-4b6d1824-20e4-597e-b639-fae401f740f0-required-by-ebaae4f5-cc13-5493-98b1-10e1abeb638f",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "4b6d1824-20e4-597e-b639-fae401f740f0",
      "directDependentGoalId": "ebaae4f5-cc13-5493-98b1-10e1abeb638f",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "The dependent evaluates a particular splash or inhalation exposure and develops measures that reduce that same route. Justifying protection from substance hazard plus activity/exposure conditions is the necessary operation; a hazard symbol alone cannot do the job."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Risikominimierung verlangt aus Stoffgefahr UND konkreter Exposition passende Schutzmaßnahmen herzuleiten. Die Spritz-/Einatemfälle des abhängigen Profils vollziehen genau diese tätigkeitsbezogene Schutzbegründung; ein Gefahrensymbol allein genügt nicht."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 34,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-5b1bb5d9-07b1-5ba9-b320-cc97be917c60-required-by-a0e8f0f2-24e2-5945-a511-597d32e73796",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "5b1bb5d9-07b1-5ba9-b320-cc97be917c60",
      "directDependentGoalId": "a0e8f0f2-24e2-5945-a511-597d32e73796",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "Both feedstock cases require finding usable sources, recording author/date/claim, extracting comparable information for equal heat or packaging function and presenting a bounded decision. Selecting, structuring and citing question-relevant information is necessary to that actual research task."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Beide Rohstofffälle verlangen eigene überprüfbare Fundstellen, gleichwertige Funktion, strukturierte Daten und ein belegt begrenztes Urteil. Ohne passende Informationsauswahl, fachliche Auswertung und Quellenangabe wäre die geforderte Recherchebewertung nicht erbracht."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 35,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-5b1bb5d9-07b1-5ba9-b320-cc97be917c60-required-by-f71a2c0a-3a6a-5b23-9fb4-1b57cfb68528",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "5b1bb5d9-07b1-5ba9-b320-cc97be917c60",
      "directDependentGoalId": "f71a2c0a-3a6a-5b23-9fb4-1b57cfb68528",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "The analgesic cases require opening specified primary information, recording the source location, interpreting chemical structures and historical population/denominator information, and making a bounded application claim. The prerequisite's source selection, interpretation and traceable reporting are necessary here."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Das Schmerzmittelprofil verlangt tatsächlich benutzte PubChem-/IQWiG-/RKI-Fundstellen und deren fachliche Auswertung nach Stoffidentität, Zeitraum und Nenner. Die Quellenerschließung ist selbst Teil der verlangten Leistung und wird nicht durch vorgegebene Modellzahlen ersetzt."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 37,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-642d5ea5-b62f-50c8-b0bd-cf132619725f-required-by-94a62b39-d4a2-5882-99d1-6886ead07726",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "642d5ea5-b62f-50c8-b0bd-cf132619725f",
      "directDependentGoalId": "94a62b39-d4a2-5882-99d1-6886ead07726",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "The protection tasks require explaining passive barriers, damaged metal coatings, galvanic electron/ion paths and sacrificial-anode consumption. Local-element and sacrificial-anode mechanisms of the prerequisite are necessary to evaluate those protection options and their failure conditions."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Die Schutzbewertung verlangt passive Barriere, galvanischen Defekt, Opferwirkung, Kontaktwege und Verbrauch kausal zu erklären. Diese Korrosionskompetenz ist notwendig, um Wartung und Schutzwirkung fachlich statt allein nach Modellkosten zu beurteilen."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 41,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-70b12d1c-abaf-45c6-ae9e-b571e9cbc126-required-by-fd7977bf-1d8e-5c5e-9c37-bd76bb2ffeef",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "70b12d1c-abaf-45c6-ae9e-b571e9cbc126",
      "directDependentGoalId": "fd7977bf-1d8e-5c5e-9c37-bd76bb2ffeef",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "The dependent uses the same NaCl melt and CuCl2 solution processes and requires ion migration, balanced electrode equations, product ratio and forced operation. The complete simple-salt electrolysis explanation is necessary; galvanic comparison adds a further operation."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Das abhängige Elektrolyseprofil verlangt selbst NaCl-Schmelze und festgelegte wässrige CuCl2-Elektrolyse, Ionenwege, Elektrodenreaktionen und erzwungenen Stoffumsatz. Die einfache Salz-Elektrolysekompetenz ist damit vollständig notwendiger Bestandteil; der Galvanikvergleich erweitert sie."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 44,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-801790f9-be3a-51fe-9b0f-3452c1bba887-required-by-4a08f31f-204c-5339-9d9f-5d2af28d5d5c",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "801790f9-be3a-51fe-9b0f-3452c1bba887",
      "directDependentGoalId": "4a08f31f-204c-5339-9d9f-5d2af28d5d5c",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "The dependent's Hess justification and real calorimetry require an energy-conserving boundary, distinguishing heat exchange from stored energy and identifying gas-energy/work exchange. Its current explicit rigid/isobaric pV cases additionally require the qualitative piston-work and changed-boundary distinctions assessed by the full first-law prerequisite."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Hess verlangt Energieerhaltung für gleiche Anfangs-/Endzustände, Kalorimetrie verlangt benannte offene/geschlossene Grenzen und die Trennung von Wärme und Arbeit. Die aktuellen starren/isobaren Transferfälle würden ohne diese vollständige qualitative System-/Energiekompetenz falsche ΔU-/ΔH-Schlüsse zulassen."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 54,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-9e656697-fc05-5aa9-9aca-871af2e89eb7-required-by-e7c3d20e-4b13-560b-b8ee-c5abca8cc624",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "9e656697-fc05-5aa9-9aca-871af2e89eb7",
      "directDependentGoalId": "e7c3d20e-4b13-560b-b8ee-c5abca8cc624",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "Actual selection and safe execution of isolation plus ASS synthesis/cleaning require understanding the substance-specific hazard information, including the meaning and limits of a pictogram and associated warning. Guessing a missing warning would not constitute safe performance; program qualification remains separate."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Die eigene Isolierungs-/ASS-Praxis muss vorhandene Gefahrstoffangaben korrekt lesen und unklare Warnungen vor einer Handlung aufklären. Piktogramm und konkreter Warnhinweis dürfen nicht verwechselt werden; das ist eine notwendige Informationsbasis sicherer praktischer Durchführung, ohne selbst eine Freigabe zu erteilen."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 56,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-9fc800d1-92d1-5ef6-81c1-33960ae034dd-required-by-e7c3d20e-4b13-560b-b8ee-c5abca8cc624",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "9fc800d1-92d1-5ef6-81c1-33960ae034dd",
      "directDependentGoalId": "e7c3d20e-4b13-560b-b8ee-c5abca8cc624",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "The isolation profile expressly requires its own unaltered masses, branches, solutions, times, temperatures, observations and calculations, separating own actions from teaching data. Traceable source/condition/unit documentation and separation of observation from interpretation are necessary to that whole practical result."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Das praktische Isolierungsprofil fordert ausdrücklich eigene Originalmengen, Rohwerte, Herkunft, Bedingungen und getrennte Deutung; unvollständige beziehungsweise ungültige Serien müssen erhalten bleiben. Diese vollständige nachvollziehbare Dokumentationskompetenz ist für Reinheit und Ausbeute unverzichtbar."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 57,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-a530ee7d-1002-5f02-ae05-a9d46410ac78-required-by-3e433dae-99f9-5a95-ad63-d5fa0b5f6836",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "a530ee7d-1002-5f02-ae05-a9d46410ac78",
      "directDependentGoalId": "3e433dae-99f9-5a95-ad63-d5fa0b5f6836",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "The enthalpy-comparison tasks use pre-evaluated bond-break/bond-formation budgets and require qualitative net direction, relative energy levels and the model boundary. These directly require the full qualitative bond-energy balance competence without imposing a new sum-calculation task."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Die Enthalpiebegründung verlangt gerade den Vergleich von Bindungsbruchbedarf und Bindungsbildungsfreisetzung auf gleicher Stoffbasis. Ohne diese qualitative Netto-Bindungsbilanz könnte ein negativer Zahlenwert nur abgelesen, die geforderte Ursache aber nicht erklärt werden."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
    },
    {
      "groupIndex": 59,
      "reviewGroupId": "goal-b759d50d-0e82-5b10-89a2-fe5271106e50-required-by-ecce0306-13dc-5563-a097-afe69805a8d6",
      "prerequisiteGoalId": "b759d50d-0e82-5b10-89a2-fe5271106e50",
      "directDependentGoalId": "ecce0306-13dc-5563-a097-afe69805a8d6",
      "A": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "classification": "physical_necessity",
        "reason": "The advanced fuel-cell cases require independently writing acidic electrode and net reactions, explaining separate proton/electron paths and a blocked proton route, before comparison with alkaline operation and supply limits. The simpler H2/O2 fuel-cell conversion and stored-carrier competence is necessary to this performance."
      },
      "B": {
        "physicalDecision": "approve",
        "reason": "Das Brennstoffzellenurteil verlangt selbst erzeugte saure/alkalische Elektrodenbilanzen, getrennte Ladungswege und Energie-/Stoffzufuhr. Die H2/O2-Basiskompetenz wird dabei vollständig benötigt, bevor Vor-/Nachteile im Versorgungskontext bewertet werden können."
      },
      "sourceAndCourseAcceptance": "separate pending jurisdiction dispositions; no source-registry approval derived from this physical pair"
